# Continuation protocol

This is an unofficial Spectacle continuation (working title Encore). AI is the maintainer’s tool, not the product story.

## Start of session

Read in order: `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/SLICES.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, `AGENTS.md`. Do only the current slice. Follow `docs/HANDOFF.md` if you are new to the repo.

## Stop

One slice per agent instance. If the slice is too big, split it in `docs/SLICES.md` and finish the first half. Do not start the next slice unless the user asks.

## End of session

Update `docs/STATUS.md` (done or partial, commands that passed, what not to redo). Add ADRs to `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Do not edit the original plan file.

## Hard limits

- Keep Objective-C + bundled JS calculators. No Swift rewrite. No Rectangle features (oracle only).
- Do not enable Sparkle on unsigned builds. Do not use spectacleapp.com’s appcast.
- Do not change window math to make an old test “look right.”
- Keep Eric Czarny’s MIT copyright on original files. Do not flatten imported git history.
